    coreHi: 'AI research tools ==paywalled reports, private company data aur latest local updates== nahi dekh sakte—aur leading sawal puchne par woh aapki haan mein haan mila sakte hain (sycophancy)!',
    analogyTitle: 'Searching Only Public Street Signs Without Entering Private Buildings',
    analogyEn: 'Asking *"Why is Product X the absolute best?"* gets a biased sales pitch. Asking ==*"Compare Product X vs Y objectively, including top 3 weaknesses of each"*== gets honest truth!',
    analogyHi: '"Product X sabse best kyun hai?" puchne par biased jawab milta hai; ==*"Product X aur Y ke pros aur cons objectively compare karo"*== puchne par sahi sach milta hai!',
    steps: [['Ask Neutrally', 'Never bake your desired conclusion into the prompt'], ['Know Paywall Gaps', 'Upload paid/internal PDFs directly when needed'], ['Check Recency', 'Verify 2026 policy/tax/pricing changes officially'], ['Request Counter-Args', 'Always ask for opposing views & limitations']],
    jobUse: 'Produces genuinely objective, boardroom-grade research instead of echo-chamber summaries.',
